historical_reply:
@124421 Got it. Let’s check which iOS version is on your iPhone X by going to Settings &gt; General &gt; About
If it’s a lower iOS version than your iPhone 7, then we’ll need to get the iPhone X updated by following these steps: https://t.co/r9sZrDtROb 
Let us know what you find.
